  <para style="h">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Efeso bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efeso bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Mamimɛ ngɛ Efeso, anɔkua Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ a suɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi: Imi Paulo nɛ ji Yesu Kristo tsɔlɔ nɛ Mawu hla, nɛ ngɛ nyɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Yi jemi ha Mawu, wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ, nɔ nɛ kɛ hiɔwe jɔɔmi babauu jɔɔ wɔ, ejakaa Kristo nihi ji wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi mi tomi ɔ je kpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kɛ je blema, loko ji e bɔ je ɔ, Mawu hla wɔ kɛ pee lɛ nitsɛ e nimli ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo ma ba tsu ha wɔ ɔ he je. Nɛ e to nɛ e maa pee wɔ klɔuklɔu nɛ yayami ko nɛ ko hi wa he ngɛ e hɛ mi, ngɛ suɔmi nɛ e suɔ wɔ ɔ he je. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />E yi mi tomi nɛ tsakee we ji kaa e ma ha nɛ Kristo nɛ e ba gbo ngɛ wa he konɛ e ngɔ wɔ kɛ piɛɛ lɛ nitsɛ e weku ɔ he. Nɛ e ha e yi mi tomi nɛ ɔ ba mi.<verse eid="EPH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa je Mawu yi ngɛ nyakpɛ suɔmi nɛ e kɛ suɔ wɔ, kɛ dloomi nɛ e dloo wɔ ngɛ e suɔmi Bi ɔ níhi nɛ wa ji ɔ he. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi babauu ɔ nya a, e kɛ e Bi ɔ muɔ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ nɛ e kɛ kpɔ wɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />E dloo wɔ kɛ dloomi nɛ pe kulaa, ejakaa e le wɔ nɛ e le nɔ́ nɛ hi ha wɔ be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="EPH 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Mawu ha nɛ wa le e laami yi mi tomi ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ e tsɔ Kristo kɛ ba ngɛ ɔ. Nɛ enɛ ɔ ji yi mi nɛ e to momoomo ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami ɔ nya. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Nɛ ke be nɛ e to ɔ su ɔ, e ma bua wɔ tsuo wa nya kɛ je he tsuaa he nɛ wa ngɛ, hiɔwe jio, zugba a nɔ jio, kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ waa kɛ lɛ nɛ hi si ngɛ Kristo mi kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo tsu ɔ he je ɔ, wa peeɔ nike níhi kɛ ha Mawu, nike níhi nɛ e suɔ. Nɛ akɛnɛ wa ngɛ e yi mi tomi ɔ mi he je ɔ, e hla wɔ kɛ je sisije kɛ pee e nihi, nɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ ya nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e to he blɔ nya kɛ je blema a. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Nɔ́ nɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae ji kaa wa je e yi, nɛ waa wo e hɛ mi nyami ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e tsu kɛ ha wɔ ɔ he, wɔ nɛ wa ji kekle nihi nɛ he Kristo nɔ ye ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo tsu ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ nihi hu nɛ nyɛ nu yi wami hemi he Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ nyɛ he Kristo nɔ ye ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ a wo wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli tsuo si ngɛ he ɔ, e wo nyɛ he so kaa Kristo nihi ji nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Wa mi nɛ e ngɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu maa ye e si womi ɔ nɔ niinɛ nɛ e ma ha wɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ nɛ e wo wɔ si ngɛ he ɔ. Mumi ɔ hu maa nɔ mi ngɛ wa mi kaa Mawu he wɔ momo, nɛ e wo si nɛ e ma ba ngɔ wɔ kɛ ho e ngɔ ya. Ngɛ enɛ ɔ hu he ɔ, e sa nɛ wa je wa anunyami Mawu ɔ yi.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, kɛ je benɛ i nu nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu mi ɔ, kɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16-17" />i jɔɔ we Mawu si nami kɛ ha nyɛ. I kaiɔ nyɛ daa ngɛ sɔlemi mi, nɛ i biɔ anunyami Mawu ɔ, wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ, nɛ e ha nyɛ nile nɛ nyɛɛ na paa, nɛ nyɛɛ nu nɔ nɛ Kristo ji ɔ sisi kɛ nɔ́ nɛ e ba tsu ha nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nɛ i sɔleɔ hu kaa e bli nyɛ mumi mi hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ na nɔ́ nɛ e tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ha a, nɛ fɔɔ si ngɛ nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ nyɛ nine maa su nɔ hwɔɔ se ɔ. I ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa a pee Mawu niatsɛ, ejakaa wɔ nɛ ji Kristo nihi ɔ, a ngɔ wɔ kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee nɛ nyɛɛ le bɔ nɛ e he wami kle hluu kɛ ha, nɛ e ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ. Jamɛ a he wami ɔ nɔuu <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />nɛ e kɛ tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje nɛ e kɛ lɛ hi anunyami ngwɔ he ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ ngɛ hiɔwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />nɛ e wo e nɔ pe matsɛ loo nɔ yelɔ loo hɛ mi nyɛɛlɔ ko. Nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ kɛ lɛ sɔ ngɛ anunyami mi ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi loo je nɛ maa ba a mi. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Mawu ngɔ níhi kulaa ngɔ wo e dɛ, nɛ e pee lɛ asafo ɔ kulaa Yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Asafo ɔ ji lɛ nitsɛ e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ngɛ mi, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peelɔ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ haa nɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Sa a, nyɛ ji nihi nɛ Mawu gbiɛ nyɛ, nɛ a ngɔ nyɛ kɛ ha neneene hɛ mi kpatami ngɛ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ je mi bi ɔmɛ nɛ yaa, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kaa mɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ kɛ yayami peemi. Nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ ha Abosiami, kɔɔhiɔ he wamitsɛ ɔ, nɔ nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ nihi nɛ tsɔ Mawu hɛ mi atuã a tsui mi amlɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Wɔ tsuo wa gbo tue kaa mɛ ngɛ be ko nɛ be ɔ mi. Wa si himi tsɔɔ kaa nimli yayamihi ji wɔ. Wa tsu yi mi wami nihi nɛ he lo kɛ juɛmi suɔ ɔ. Wa je sisi kɛ yayami peemi, ejakaa a fɔ wɔ kɛ yayami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu gbiɛmi ngɛ wa nɔ kaa ni kpa amɛ nɔuu.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Se Mawu mɔbɔ nami hiɛ babauu, nɛ e suɔ wɔ saminya. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ wa gbo ngɛ mumi mi nɛ wa ngɛ kɛ ha hɛ mi kpatami, ejakaa wa pee yayami ɔ, e ha nɛ wa hɛ ka ekohu benɛ e tle Kristo si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, nɛ e kɛ he wa yi wami ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami ɔ nya. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />E tle wɔ si kɛ je gbogboe muɔ mi kɛ ba anunyami mi, kɛ Kristo nɛ waa kɛ lɛ tsuo hii si ngɛ hiɔwe matsɛ yemi ɔ mi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo Yesu tsu ha wɔ ɔ he je. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu maa ngɔ wɔ kɛ pee nɔ hyɛmi nɔ́ be fɛɛ be kɛ tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ e mi mi jɔmi ɔ hiɛ fuu ha, kaa bɔ nɛ e je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e pee ha wɔ kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi ɔ he je ɔ, e he nyɛ yi wami kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ; nɛ yi wami hemi ɔ tsa pi nyɛ dɛ mi nɛ e je, se Mawu nɔ́ke nɔ i. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Nɛ yi wami hemi ɔ pi ni tsumi kpakpa ko nɛ wa tsu ɔ e he hiɔwo, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa ti nɔ ko nɛ ko fĩa. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Mawu nitsɛ nɛ pee wɔ bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e ha wɔ wami he nɛ je Kristo Yesu mi ɔ; nɛ kɛ je blema lokoo nɛ e to kaa waa ngɔ wa wami ɔ kɛ ye kɛ bua ni kpahi.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nyɛ hɛ ko je nɔ kaa sa a, wɔ jali ji nyɛ, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsɛɔ nyɛ nihi nɛ li Mawu kɛ nihi nɛ a “he tsɔ we.” Se mɛ hu a he tsɔ we, tsɛ be ɔ, a peeɔ kusumihi nɛ nihi nɛ le Mawu ɔ peeɔ, ejakaa a woɔ a he nyumu mi kɛ tsɔɔ kaa a le Mawu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Nyɛ kai kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ nyɛɛ kɛ Kristo bɔɛ kulaa, nɛ Mawu bi ɔmɛ pee nyɛ he nyɛli, nɛ nyɛ be yemi kɛ buami he si womi. Nyɛ laa, ejakaa Mawu be nyɛ se nɛ nyɛ be he nɔ kami ko.<verse eid="EPH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo tsa adesa kɛ Mawu a kpɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ peeɔ Kristo Yesu níhi. Kekle ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu he kɛ, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ a sɔ̃ nyɛ kɛ su e he haa ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu Kristo ngɔ e muɔ ɔ kɛ tsu ha nyɛ ɔ he je.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ejakaa Kristo nɔ nɛ wa maa gu kɛ na he jɔmi. E ngɔ wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ pee kake nɛ e kɛ he jɔmi ba wa kpɛti. Nɛ e je ninyɛ nɛ ngɛ wa kpɛti ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kɛ gu e gbenɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e je hetsɛ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ wo kɛ ba Yuda bi kɛ ma je li a kpɛti nɛ haa nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ yeɔ a he ɔ, ejakaa e gbo konɛ e kɛ gu jamɛ a mlaa amɛ kulaa. Kɛkɛ nɛ e ngɔ nimli enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a ke a he yi ɔ nɛ e kɛ mɛ pee lɛ nitsɛ e he níhi; nɛ kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ́ ɔ, e bua wɔ kɛ pee kake nɛ tue mi jɔmi ba wa kpɛti. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Akɛnɛ wa plɛ nɔmlɔ tso kake he nihi jehanɛ ɔ he je ɔ, pɛ nɛ ngɛ wa kpɛti ɔ jɔ, ejakaa a dla wɔ tsuo waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti kɛ gu Sɛumi Tso ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Nɛ Kristo ba ba fiɛ he jɔmi Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ma je li nɛ a kɛ Mawu kpɛti kɛ lokoo ɔ, kɛ wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ su e he ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Jehanɛ ɔ, wɔ tsuo, ma je li jio, Yuda bi jio, wa ma nyɛ ba Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yemi kɛ buami nɔ, ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo tsu kɛ ha wɔ ɔ he je.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, amlɔ nɛ ɔ, tsa pi nibwɔhi ji nyɛ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi hu, nɛ nyɛ pi ma setsɛmɛ hulɔ ngɛ hiɔwe, se mohu Mawu nitsɛ weku mi bimɛ kɛ e we bi.<verse eid="EPH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Nɛ nyɛ ji nihi nɛ a fia ngɔ ma bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ gbali ɔmɛ a sisi tomi ɔ nɔ, nɛ nyɛ kɔ̃ nya tɛ ji Kristo Yesu nitsɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Wɔ nihi nɛ wa heɔ e nɔ yeɔ tsuo ɔ, a pee wɔ kɛ Kristo kake kaa Mawu Sɔlemi We he afɛu níhi nɛ ngɛ wae. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Nɛ nyɛ hu a ngɔ nyɛ kɛ piɛ a he, nɛ Mumi ɔ pee nyɛ kake nɛ nyɛ peeɔ Mawu we ɔ mi bimɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu he wami nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Imi Paulo, nɛ ji Kristo sɔmɔlɔ ɔ, i ngɛ tsu mi ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ ngɛ nyɛ he je, ejakaa i fiɛ ke nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ hu Mawu we bimɛ ji nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />I he ye kaa nyɛ le momo kaa Mawu ha mi ni tsumi pɔtɛɛ nɛ ɔ kaa ma fiɛ nɛ ma tsɔɔ e dloomi nɛ e kɛ ha nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />kaa bɔ nɛ i de kuku ngɛ ye womi ɔmɛ kake mi be ko ɔ. Mawu nitsɛ nɛ e je e laami blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi kaa e dloomi ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ hu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee nɛ ma kɛ tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ i plɛ kɛ le ni nɛ ɔmɛ ha. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Mawu ha we nɛ nimli a bimɛ nɛ a le kikɛmɛ a laami sane nɛ ɔ ngɛ blema be ɔmɛ a mi; se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a je kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ e bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ gbali ɔmɛ kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Nɛ laami sane ɔ ji kaa ma je li ɔmɛ maa piɛɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he nɛ a ma gba Mawu weto ni nɛ ngɛ kɛ ha e bimɛ ɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ; nɛ e ma tsɛ mɛ tsuo kɛ ba e jami mi, nɛ jɔɔmi nguahi nɛ e wo he si nɛ e ma ha kɛ gu Kristo nɔ ɔ, e maa pee mɛ hu a nɔ́ ke ji a ngɔ Kristo he Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ nɔ́ nɛ e ba tsu kɛ ha mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mawu ha mi kikɛmɛ a nyakpɛ he blɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ ma jaje e blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔ kɛ de nɔ tsuaa nɔ. Nɛ e ha mi he wami kɛ nyɛmi pɔtɛɛ ko nɛ ma kɛ tsu he ni saminya.<verse eid="EPH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ ha kaa i pee we nɔ ko nɛ sa kaa a ha mi kikɛmɛ a he blɔ nɛ ɔ, ami nɔ́ nɛ he be se nami pe kulaa ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli a kpɛti ɔ, ami mohu ji nɔ nɛ a hla kɛ ha ni tsumi titli nɛ ɔ, kaa ma de ma je li ɔmɛ bua jɔmi munyu nɛ ji weto ni nɛ ngɛ kɛ ha mɛ ngɛ Kristo mi nɛ se be poe ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Nɛ ma ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ le kaa Mawu ji ma je li ɔmɛ hu a Yiwamihelɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ bɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ɔ to he blɔ nya ngɛ laami mi kɛ je sisije ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />E pee enɛ ɔ nɛ e kɛ ha nɛ nɔ yeli nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ a na nɛ a le bɔ nɛ e juɛmi mi kuɔ ha, kaa e bua e we bimɛ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ tsuo a nya kɛ wo e jami ɔ mi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Mawu pee enɛ ɔ ngɛ yi mi nɛ e to kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ ɔ nya.<verse eid="EPH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Jehanɛ ɔ wa ma nyɛ ba Mawu hɛ mi nɛ wa be gbeye yee, nɛ wa ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami kaa e ma nya wa he, ke wa ba ngɛ Kristo biɛ mi nɛ wa he e nɔ ye ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛ na tsui ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ mi pee ngɛ hiɛ ɔ he je. Nyɛ he je nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nae ngɛ, nɛ e sa nɛ nyɛɛ na kaa a wo nyɛ hɛ mi nyami, konɛ nyɛ he mi nɛ wa nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14-15" />Ke i susu e nile kɛ e blɔ nya tomi ɔ he ɔ, i kplaa si nɛ i sɔleɔ kɛ haa Mawu we bihi, ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe momo ɔ, kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ tsuo a Tsɛ ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 3:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />kaa e je e anunyami blɔ nya tomi babauu ɔmɛ a mi nɛ e wo nyɛ he wami kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Nɛ i sɔleɔ hu kaa Kristo nɛ hi nyɛ tsui mi be fɛɛ be, nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ pi si ngɛ Mawu nyakpɛ suɔmi ɔ mi; <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18-19" />konɛ nyɛ, kaa Mawu bimɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ nu he ngɛ nyɛ mi nɛ nyɛɛ nu Kristo suɔmi ɔ, e kami kɛ e mi blimi kɛ e mi kuɔmi kɛ e nɔ kuɔmi bɔ nɛ e ngɛ tutuutu ɔ sisi. E suɔmi ɔ kle bɔ nɛ nyɛ be e nyagbe nae, nɛ nyɛ be e sisi hu nue kɛ pi si. Se nyagbe mi ɔ, Mawu nitsɛ ma hyi nyɛ mi obɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu nɔ nɛ kɛ gu e he wami babauu nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ wa mi ɔ nɔ́ ɔ, e pee níhi fuu kɛ ha wɔ pe bɔ nɛ wa ma bi lɛ aloo wa ma susu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha lɛ kɛ ya neneene kɛ yi nɔhi kulaa ngɛ asafo ɔ yi wami hemi he blɔ nya nɛ e to kɛ gu Kristo nɔ́ ɔ he.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ami nɛ a wo mi tsu mi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ sɔmɔmi he ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ sa tsɛmi nɛ a tsɛ nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si nɛ nyɛ ko pee gidigidi. Nyɛɛ to tsui si kɛ ha nyɛ bi, nɛ nyɛ na tsui kɛ ha nyɛ bi a tɔmihi ngɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ he je. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde be fɛɛ be nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ kudɔ nyɛ tsuo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ tue mi jɔmi nɛ hi nyɛ kpɛti.<verse eid="EPH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dloomi nike ni slɔɔtohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nɔmlɔ tso kake he níhi ji wɔ tsuo, nɛ wa ngɛ Mumi kake; nɛ a tsɛ wɔ tsuo kɛ ha hwɔɔ se si himi kpakpa kake too. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ejakaa wɔɔ lɛɛ wa ngɛ Nutsɔ kake kɛ hemi kɛ yemi kake kɛ baptisimi kake, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />nɛ wɔ tsuo wa ngɛ Mawu kɛ Tsɛ kake nɛ ngɛ wɔ kulaa wa nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ wɔ tsuo wa mi, nɛ e ngɛ wa he tsuaa he. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Se wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ɔ, Kristo ngɔ dloomi nɔ́ ke nɔ titli ko ngɔ ha lɛ kɛ je e nike ni babauu ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="EPH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ Latsɛ ɔ yo nɛ e de ke, benɛ Kristo kuɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ e si temi ɔ se benɛ e ye Abosiami nɔ ɔ, e ngɔ nike níhi fuu kɛ ke nimli. <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Nɔ́ nɛ e de ji e kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya. Nɛ e sisi tsɔɔmi ji e kple si kɛ ba zugba a nɔ kekle. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Nɛ nɔ́ nɛ kple si ɔ, lɛ nɔuu ji nɔ nɛ kpale kuɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a nɛ, konɛ lɛ nitsɛ e hi nɔ tsuaa nɔ mi ngɛ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Wɔ nihi nɛ wa ji bɔfo ɔmɛ ɔ, a ha wɔ he wami slɔɔto komɛ; nɛ ni komɛ hu e pee mɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛli; ni komɛ hu e ha mɛ dloomi nike ni bɔ nɛ a ma nyɛ gbla nihi kɛ ba Kristo ngɔ, nɛ a ye kɛ bua mɛ konɛ a he e nɔ nɛ a ye kaa a Yiwamihelɔ; nɛ ni komɛ hu e wo mɛ osɔfohi nɛ a hyɛ e we bi ɔmɛ a nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ to kpakalɔ hyɛɔ e tohi a nɔ ɔ, nɛ a kpaka mɛ nɛ a tsɔɔ mɛ ni ngɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi ɔ nya.<verse eid="EPH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Mɛni he je nɛ e ha wɔ dloomi nike ni slɔɔtohi nɛ wa nyɛ wa kɛ pee ni pɔtɛɛ komɛ saminya ngɛ? Ejakaa e sa nɛ a wo Mawu we bimɛ he wami konɛ a nyɛ nɛ a tsu e ni tsumi ɔ saminya. A hyɛ asafo ɔ nɛ ji Kristo nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ma si kpɛii nɛ e wa, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />kɛ ya si nyagbe mi nɛ wɔ tsuo wa ma na hemi kɛ yemi kake ngɛ wa yi wami hemi kɛ wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ mi, nɔ́ nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ. Nɛ wɔ tsuo wa maa wa kɛ pi si ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi, kɛ ya si he nɛ wa ma hyi banebane kɛ Kristo ngɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ wa be wa ni pee kaa jokuɛwi hu, nɛ wa juɛmi maa hi tsakee be fɛɛ be ngɛ nɔ nɛ wa he ye ɔ he, ejakaa nɔ ko de wɔ nɔ kpa ko, aloo nɔ ko mlɔɔ wɔ kɛ munyu kpa ko nɛ ngɛ kaa anɔkuale ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15-16" />Se mohu wa maa nyɛɛ anɔkuale ɔ se be fɛɛ be, nɛ waa pee wa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ anɔkuale blɔ nɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa pee kaa Kristo, nɔ́ nɛ ji Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ Yi, nɛ ji asafo ɔ. Ngɛ e blɔ tsɔɔmi nya a, a to Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tsuo blɔ nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ kɛ pee kake, nɛ e he tsuaa he yeɔ kɛ buaa he kpa amɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ haa nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tsuo he wami nɛ e waa nɛ e naa suɔmi babauu.<verse eid="EPH 4:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Si himi he ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Nɛ i ngɛ enɛ ɔ dee ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi ke, nyɛ ko ba nyɛ je mi kaa bɔ nɛ nihi nɛ a he we a yi wami ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ejakaa mɛɛ lɛɛ a juɛmi mi wo diblii kpii nɛ a lu. A tsui nɛ a nga nya a mi wo diblii. A kɛ Mawu si himi kpɛti kɛ, ejakaa a nga a juɛmi nya kɛ wo lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a nui e blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ a sisi. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Kaa a maa pee kpakpa loo yayami pi a kɔmɔ hu, nɛ a ngɔ a he kɛ ha mu ni tsumihi. Nɔ́ ko nɔ́ ko pui a tsui nɔ, ejakaa a yayami juɛmi kɛ basabasa níhi a se dimi ɔ ji nihi nɛ ngɛ mɛ gblae.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ Kristo tsɔɔ we nyɛ kikɛmɛ a je mi bami nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ke e ngɛ mi kaa nyɛ nu e gbi, nɛ nyɛ kase e he anɔkuale sane ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />lɛɛ nyɛ sake nyɛ sa je mi bami su yaya a nɛ puɛ kɛ he lo se dimi kɛ sisimi ɔ kɛ fɔ he.<verse eid="EPH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Jehanɛ ɔ, e sa nɛ nyɛ subai kɛ je mi bami nɛ bɔni tsakemi bɔ nɛ maa hi. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Nyɛ tsake nyɛ je mi bami nɛ nyɛɛ pee nimli hehi nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu, nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ a na nyɛ kaa nyɛ tsake niinɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ kpa lakpa yemi, nɛ e kɛ e nyɛmi nɛ tu anɔkuale, ejakaa nɔmlɔ tso kake he níhi ji wɔ tsuo, nɛ ke wa ngɛ wa bi lakpa yee ɔ, wa ngɛ wa he awi yee. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nɛ ke nyɛ na abofu ɔ, nyɛ ko pee yayami; nɛ nyɛ ko ha nɛ pu nɛ nɔ si ngɛ nyɛ abofu ɔ nɔ, se mohu nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ he nɔuu. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ke pi ja a, Abosiami ma na nyɛ he blɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu, ke julɔ ko ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, e ko ju hu, nɛ e kɛ e nine nɛ tsu ni tsumi kpakpa konɛ e kɛ ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ ngɛ fimi mi ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ munyu yaya ko nɛ je nyɛ nya, se mohu nyɛɛ sɛɛ ni kpakpa nɛ he maa ba se nami kɛ ha nyɛ bi, konɛ e pee dloomi nɔ́ kɛ ha mɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ nyɛ je mi bami nɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ maa dɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ. Ejakaa lɛ nɛ e yeɔ nyɛ he odase kaa Mawu bimɛ ji nyɛ. Nɛ e ji nɔ mi mami nɔ́ kaa nyɛ maa ye nyɛ he ngɛ Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Nyɛ ha nɛ mi mi doomi tsuo kɛ mi mi la kɛ abofu kɛ pɛ kɛ ninyɛ kɛ munyu yaya tumi kulaa se nɛ po ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Se mohu, nyɛ mi mi nɛ jɔ, nɛ nyɛ na nyɛ si bi a he tsui, nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ si bi a tɔmihi kɛ ke mɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu hu ngɔ ke nyɛ benɛ nyɛ plɛ Kristo nihi ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Nyɛɛ pee Mawu kaseli ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi, kaa bɔ nɛ bi nɛ e tsɛ suɔ lɛ kaseɔ e tsɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hu suɔ nyɛ nɛ e ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e he kɛ ha Mawu kaa bɔ sami nɔ́ kɛ je nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ ɔ. Nɛ Mawu na he bua jɔmi, ejakaa suɔmi nɛ Kristo ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ ngɛ kaa nu je via kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ ajuama bɔmi, mu ni tsumi loo hɛ kɔ nɛ hi nyɛ kpɛti. Nyɛ ko ha nɛ a tu nyɛ he munyu kaa nyɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ eko pee. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu, zo ni tsumi kɛ yakayaka ni sɛɛmi kɛ fɛu yemi nɛ sɛ ɔ, e ko hi nyɛ kpɛti; se mohu nyɛ kai nyɛ he ngɛ ni kpakpahi nɛ Mawu pee kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ he, nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ sina kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Nɛ nyɛɛ le enɛ ɔ kaa, ajuama bɔlɔ ko loo mu ni tsulɔ ko loo hɛ tsulɔ ko be blɔ nya ngɛ Kristo kɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi. Hɛ tsulɔ ɔ, e ji wɔ jalɔ, ejakaa e suɔ je nɛ ɔ mi ni kpakpa amɛ, nɛ e jaa mɛ pe Mawu. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ mlɔɔ nyɛ ngɛ yayami nɛ ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa Mawu muklii mi fumi baa nihi nɛ gboɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ tue ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ nɛ ko bɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ejakaa sa a, nyɛ tsui mi wo diblii kanikani; se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ la ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi, nɛ e sa kaa a na ngɛ nyɛ je mi bami mi. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Ngɛ la nɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ da, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ hi nɛ ji anɔkuale.<verse eid="EPH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Nɛ nyɛɛ kase nɔ́ nɛ sa Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ he nɛ ko wo diblii mi ni tsumi ɔmɛ nɛ wui yiblii kpakpa amɛ a mi, nɛ nyɛ ko laa a nɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />E ji hɛ mi si puemi kaa ma wo diblii mi ni tsumi ɔmɛ a ta, nɛ ji níhi nɛ nihi nɛ li Mawu ɔ a tsuɔ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Se ke nyɛ je mɛ kpo ɔ, la a kpɛɔ ngɛ a yayami ɔ nɔ, nɛ ke a na bɔ nɛ a ngɛ ha kaa a hí anɔkuale mi ɔ, a ti nihi tsakeɔ nɛ a plɛɔ la bimɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu de ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a mi ke, “O he nɛ tsiɛ, mo mahe hwɔlɔ, nɛ o te si kɛ je gbeje, nɛ Kristo maa tso ha mo” ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15-16" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya ngɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa hi si kɛ ha a he, ejakaa be yobuhi ji enɛ ɔmɛ. Nyɛ ko pee nyɛ he kuasiahi. Nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ tɛ. Nɛ ke nyɛ na kpakpa peemi he blɔ ɔ, nyɛ gbo he dengme. <verse eid="EPH 5:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nyɛ ko pee nyɛ he nihi nɛ susuu we yi mi, se mohu nyɛ hla nɛ nyɛ di níhi nɛ ji Nutsɔ ɔ suɔmi nya ni ɔmɛ a se nɛ nyɛɛ pee. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Nyɛ ko de da, ejakaa yakayaka ni peemi kɛ da demi nɛ nyɛɔ, se mohu nyɛ hyi banebane kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ konɛ e kpaka nyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Nyɛɛ sɛɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he ni ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ nyɛ je e yi kɛ yi jemi lahi kɛ mumi mi lahi, nɛ nyɛɛ fia saku, nɛ nyɛɛ je nyɛ tsui mi kɛ la kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Nyɛɛ na wa Mawu kɛ wa Tsɛ ɔ si daa ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ he be fɛɛ be ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si kɛ ha nyɛ bi nɛ nyɛ kɛ wo Kristo hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Nyɛ yigbayi ɔmɛ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si ha nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ huno ɔmɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ baa nyɛ he si kɛ haa Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ejakaa nyumu ɔ ji yo ɔ e nɔ hyɛlɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hu ji asafo ɔ nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ. Nɛ e ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e wami kɛ ha asafo ɔ nɔ hyɛmi nɛ e pee e Kpɔlɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ asafo ɔ baa e he si kɛ haa Kristo ɔ, ja a nɔuu e sa nɛ nyɛ yigbayi ɔmɛ hu nyɛɛ pee kɛ ha nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ huno ɔmɛ ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Nyɛ nyumu ɔmɛ hu nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ yi ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hu suɔ asafo ɔ nɛ e gbo kɛ ha lɛ ɔ, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />konɛ e wo baptisimi kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ tsukɔ e he nɛ e pee lɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Nɛ e ngɔ lɛ kɛ ha lɛ nitsɛ e he kaa anunyami asafo klɔuklɔu nɛ mu ko loo tɔtɔmi ko kulaa be e he. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Kikɛ ɔ nɛ e sa kaa nyumu ɔmɛ a suɔ a yi ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a suɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ tsohi. Ejakaa akɛnɛ nyumu kɛ e yo plɛ nɔmlɔ kake jehanɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nyumu ɔ suɔ e yo ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e he nɛ e suɔ, nɛ e ngɛ e he kpakpa pee. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29-30" />Nɔ ko nyɛ́ lɛ nitsɛ e nɔmlɔ tso, se mohu e hyɛɔ e nɔ saminya nɛ e lɛ ɔ lɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hyɛɔ e nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ji asafo ɔ nɔ ɔ. Nɛ e Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he níhi ji wɔ.<verse eid="EPH 5:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ nyumu ma si e tsɛ kɛ e nyɛ, nɛ e maa pɛtɛ e yo he, nɛ mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ kulaa a ma plɛ he lo kake. <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />I le kaa kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ sisi numi wa, se e tsɔɔ Kristo Nɔmlɔ tso he níhi nɛ wa ji ɔ nya.<verse eid="EPH 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ dee ekohu ke, e sa kaa nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ e yo kaa lɛ nitsɛ e he, konɛ yo ɔ hu nɛ bu e huno ɔ saminya nɛ e je e yi, nɛ e wo e hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Bimɛ, nyɛɛ bu nyɛ fɔli; enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ da nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ pee, ejakaa Mawu wo nyɛ nɔ hyɛmi he wami ɔ kɛ wo a dɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Mawu Kita Nyɔngma amɛ a kpɛti kekle nɔ́ nɛ si womi piɛ he ɔ deɔ ke, “Moo bu o tsɛ kɛ o nyɛ; <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />konɛ e hi ha mo, nɛ o se nɛ kɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Nɛ nyɛ fɔli ɔmɛ hu, nyɛ ko hi nyɛ bi ɔmɛ a mi mi la woe, se mohu nyɛ tsɔ se mɛ ngɛ suɔmi kɛ ga womi mi kaa bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ to ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Nyɛ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ bu nyɛ nutsɔ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ sɔmɔ mɛ saminya kɛ gbeye yemi kɛ suɔmi. Nyɛ sɔmɔ mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma sɔmɔ Kristo ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6-7" />Nyɛ ko sɔmɔ mɛ kɛ hɛ mi suɔmi. Nyɛ kpa nyɛ tsui mi kɛ tsu ni ha mɛ be fɛɛ be kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa pee kɛ ha Kristo ɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji Mawu suɔmi nya ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Nɛ nyɛ kai kaa Tsɛ ɔ maa wo sɔmɔlɔ kɛ nutsɔ ɔ tsuo hiɔ ngɛ nɔ́ kpakpa ko nɛ mo nɔ o maa pee ɔ he.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Nɛ nyɛ nutsɔ ɔmɛ hu, nyɛɛ hɛɛ nyɛ sɔmɔli ɔmɛ saminya, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ nɛ hi si kaa bɔ nɛ i ke a kɛ nyɛ hu nɛ hi si ɔ. Nyɛ ko wo a he gbeye; nɛ nyɛ kai kaa nyɛ hu Kristo sɔmɔli ji nyɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ tsuo ngɛ Nutsɔ kake ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ e hyɛ we nimli a hɛ mi.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa he wami ngɛ Mawu dɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Nyagbe ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ kaie kaa nyɛ he wami nami maa je Nutsɔ ɔ he wami nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ mi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Nyɛɛ wo Mawu ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ kulaa konɛ nyɛ nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ye Abosiami ga tsɔmi ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ejakaa tsa pi nimli adesahi nɛ waa kɛ ngɛ ta hwue ɔ, se mohu mumi yayamihi kɛ nɔ yeli kpanakuhi nɛ a hɛɛ Abosiami he wami, nɛ a ji je nɛ ɔ nɔ yeli ngɛ diblii mi.<verse eid="EPH 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ kpla Mawu ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ eko fɛɛ eko konɛ ke he nyɛlɔ ɔ ba tua nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ nyɛ e nya nɛ nyɛɛ da, nɛ lɔ ɔ se hu nyɛ nyɛ si nɛ nyɛɛ da kpɛii.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Se loko ji nyɛ ma nyɛ enɛ ɔ maa pee ɔ, ja nyɛ pee nyɛ he anɔkuale yeli kɛ dali. Nɛ lɔ ɔmɛ maa pee nyɛ mlɛmi kpa kɛ nyɛ gugue mi dama. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Nɛ nyɛɛ wo tokota nɛ ma ha nyɛ nyɛɛmi maa sɔ kɛ fiɛ Mawu kɛ Nɔmlɔ kpɛti he jɔmi Manye Munyu ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Nyɛɛ hɛɛ hemi kɛ yemi mi kpɛii, nɛ lɔ ɔ hu ji dama nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ nyɛ Abosiami ka amɛ a nɔ maa ye. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Nyɛɛ bɔ nyɛ yi wami hemi he mɔde, nɛ nyɛɛ hɛɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ mi wawɛɛ, ejakaa e ji nyɛ mumi mi klaate.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Nyɛɛ sɔle be tsuaa be nɛ nyɛ bi Mawu níhi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ suɔ ɔ. Nyɛ kpa nyɛ hiami nɔ́ ɔmɛ a he pɛɛ be fɛɛ be, nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle wawɛɛ be tsuaa be kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Nyɛɛ sɔle kɛ ha ami hulɔ, nɛ nyɛ bi Mawu nɛ e ha mi nya nɛ ma kɛ fiɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he sane kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi, nɛ ma nyɛ ma de mɛ anɔkuale ɔ kaa ma je li ɔmɛ hu ma na yi wami hemi. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a wo mi kɔsɔkɔsɔ ngɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ i ngɛ fiɛe ɔ he. Se i ngɛ pɛɛ kpae kaa e ha mi he wami nɛ ma ya nɔ ma fiɛ kɛ kã ngɛ tsu ɔ mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ sa kaa ma pee ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Wa suɔlɔ nyɛmi kpakpa Tihiko nɛ ji anɔkuale yemi kɛ bualɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ mi ɔ, maa bɔ nyɛ bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɔ yae ha. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Enɛ ɔ he titli nɛ i tsɔ lɛ nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ le bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ ha, konɛ e ha nɛ nyɛ he nɛ wa nyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ye nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli, he jɔmi kɛ suɔmi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ je Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Mawu dloomi kɛ jɔɔmi ɔ nɛ kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ suɔ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo anɔkuale mi ɔ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>